Build ccv and NNC into one shared library

One copy of the CUDA fatbin per process instead of one per binary. sqlite is
also included, because Store.swift and ccv_nnc_tensor_read share handles. The
transitive sub-libraries are retained by alwayslink in @ccv, since
cc_shared_library whole-archives only its direct deps.
